Subject: [PATCH 3/7] arm64: dts: renesas: r8a77970: add DU support
Date: Fri,  6 Apr 2018 15:08:08 +0200
Message-Id: <1523020092-25540-4-git-send-email-jacopo+renesas@jmondi.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.7.4
